{"api": "mdot_sha_milepoints", "as_of": "MDOT SHA Milepoints data consists of point geometric features which represent the measures that have been calibrated along each roadway within the State of Maryland.  Each roadway segment has been calibrated with measures that increase for every 10th, 100th, & 1000th of a mile. This layer shows 10th of a mile specifically.\n\nMDOT SHA Milepoints data is updated and published on an annual basis.  This data is for the year 2018.\n\nData Last Updated:  11/05/2019, \n\nService Last Publshied: 04/26/2020, \nPublisher: J.Lloyd (jlloyd@mdot.maryland.gov)", "bytes": 15230, "date": "2026-10-27", "event": "probe", "headers": {"cache-control": "must-revalidate,max-age=0,public", "content-type": "application/json; charset=UTF-8"}, "key": "4f76c218a569719c", "latency_ms": 136, "status": 200, "truncated": false, "ts": "2026-10-27T03:37:34.254677+00:00", "url": "https://maps.roads.maryland.gov/arcgis/rest/services/Milepoints/MilepointsVW_Maryland_MDOTSHA/FeatureServer/0?f=json"}
